hology or were perceived to  potentially contradict it at the end of  the day effects resurrection would come  solely via the mandalorian and will  continue with the book of boba fett  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stuff are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

